#: source/command-ref/new-cli/nix3-profile-wipe-history.md:24
msgid "Description"
msgstr ""

#: source/command-ref/new-cli/nix3-profile-wipe-history.md:26
msgid ""
"This command deletes non-current versions of a profile, making it impossible "
"to roll back to these versions. By default, all non-current versions are "
"deleted. With `--older-than` _N_`d`, all non-current versions older than _N_ "
"days are deleted."
msgstr ""

